<%# ─────────────────────────────── HERO ─────────────────────────────── %>
<section class="section surface">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <span class="kicker">Book a call</span>
    <h1 class="h1" style="margin: 20px 0 28px;">
      Thirty minutes. <em>No pitch.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Bring one process that feels broken. We'll walk through it together. You&rsquo;ll leave the call knowing whether it&rsquo;s worth automating, roughly what it would cost and whether Consilix is the right partner for it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ─────────────────────────── TWO-COLUMN ─────────────────────────── %>
<section class="section-sm surface-alt rule-top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-grid">

      <div class="contact-primary">
        <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
          <div class="num">01</div>
          <div class="head-body">
            <span class="kicker">The direct route</span>
            <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 6px;">Put it straight in the diary.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" style="background: var(--paper); border-color: var(--rule);">
          <div class="meta">Book on James&rsquo;s calendar</div>
          <h3 class="h3" style="margin: 10px 0 16px;">30-minute call</h3>
          <p class="muted" style="max-width: 48ch; margin-bottom: 24px;">
            Direct link. No qualifying form. You pick a slot, the diary sends a Google Meet, we talk.
          </p>
          <%= link_to "Open the calendar", "https://calendar.app.google/5WcBDhygYkuZqrV96", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "btn btn-primary" %>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-info">
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="meta">Email</span>
            <a class="link-text" href="mailto:hello@consilix.ai">hello@consilix.ai</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="meta">Phone</span>
            <a class="link-text" href="tel:+447912884349">+44 7912 884 349</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="meta">Response</span>
            <span>Within one working day. Usually faster.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="meta">Based</span>
            <span>London, UK &mdash; available across the UK.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-secondary">
        <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <div class="head-body">
            <span class="kicker">Prefer to write first</span>
            <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 6px;">Tell me about the problem.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <%= form_with url: contact_path, method: :post, local: true, data: { turbo: false } do |form| %>
          <div class="form-field">
            <%= form.label :name, "Your name" %>
            <%= form.text_field :name, required: true, autocomplete: "name" %>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <%= form.label :email, "Email" %>
            <%= form.email_field :email, required: true, autocomplete: "email" %>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <%= form.label :company, "Company" %>
            <%= form.text_field :company, autocomplete: "organization" %>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <%= form.label :message, "What's the problem you'd bring to a 30-minute call?" %>
            <%= form.text_area :message, required: true, rows: 5 %>
          </div>
          <%= form.submit "Send", class: "btn btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>

        <p class="faint" style="font-size: 13px; margin-top: 20px; max-width: 52ch;">
          Your details come straight to my inbox. No CRM funnel, no drip sequence. If the call isn&rsquo;t the right fit, I&rsquo;ll tell you in the reply and &mdash; where I can &mdash; point you at someone better.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ─────────────────────────── EXPECT ─────────────────────────── %>
<section class="section surface rule-top">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="num">03</div>
      <div class="head-body">
        <span class="kicker">What to expect on the call</span>
        <h2 class="h2">Three questions, roughly in this order.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>
        <span class="expect-n mono">01</span>
        <div>
          <strong>What is the process that broke and for whom?</strong>
          <p>Who runs it today, how often, how long does it take and where does it hurt the most?</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="expect-n mono">02</span>
        <div>
          <strong>What have you already tried?</strong>
          <p>Tools you&rsquo;ve bought, contractors you&rsquo;ve hired, spreadsheets you&rsquo;ve rebuilt. What worked partially and what didn&rsquo;t stick.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="expect-n mono">03</span>
        <div>
          <strong>What does &ldquo;worth it&rdquo; look like?</strong>
          <p>Hours back per week? Faster client-turnaround? A specific person unblocked? Without this, the automation optimises for the wrong thing.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 64px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .contact-info {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .contact-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 6px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--rule);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .contact-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

  .expect-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .expect-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .expect-list li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .expect-n {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .expect-list strong {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .expect-list p { margin-top: 6px; color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-row { grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; }
  }
</style>
